Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:20:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: deliver group attachments into each native session
 without replay

Reuse native attachment validation and staging, persist content hashes in delivery receipts, and keep rejected drafts editable. Cover per-recipient failures, idempotency, decoding, history persistence, and composer uploads with service, storage, HTTP and renderer tests.
